OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a chilly start, but
OL,6,Fstaying mainly dry and bright with
OL,7,Fsome sunny spells. However, there will
OL,8,Fbe isolated light showers. Light north
OL,9,For northwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and often clear this
OL,12,Fevening and overnight, turning chilly
OL,13,Fwith a touch of frost in places. The
OL,14,Fodd mist and fog patch also possible.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FDry and bright with sunny
OL,17,Fspells. Mist and fog cloud become
OL,18,Fwidespread at night if skies remain
OL,19,Fclear. Winds will be light and
OL,20,Fvariable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
