OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FPlenty
OL,6,Fdry and settled weather under an area
OL,7,Fof high pressure. Variable cloud
OL,8,Famounts with some clear or sunny
OL,9,Fspells possible at times. Frost and
OL,10,Ffog if skies remain clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
